---
/*
 * Illustration 3 — IT services with AI delivery, the future operating model.
 *
 * Three visual moments stacked:
 *   A. Team composition · old (15-person SI) vs new (3-person AI-native + platform)
 *   B. The 90/10 split · AI-generated vs expert-human
 *   C. Compounding curve · cost per project drops as platform leverage accumulates
 */
---

<section class="df" id="delivery-future">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="s-head">
      <span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span>Section 05 &middot; The future operating model</span>
      <h2>Three-person teams.<br/><em>90% AI-generated</em>. Platform leverage that compounds.</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        The operating model an SI walks into on day one of the acquisition. Smaller delivery teams, higher AI-generation ratio, and a cost curve that bends down on every engagement &mdash; not up.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- A. Team composition · old vs new -->
    <div class="moment">
      <div class="m-head">
        <span class="m-tag">A</span>
        <h3>Team composition &mdash; per 90-day engagement</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="teams">
        <article class="team team-old">
          <header>
            <span class="team-tag">Body-shop SI</span>
            <span class="team-count">15 people</span>
          </header>
          <div class="team-grid">
            <div class="tg-row"><span class="tg-k">PM</span><span class="dots-old"><span></span></span></div>
            <div class="tg-row"><span class="tg-k">Architects</span><span class="dots-old"><span></span><span></span></span></div>
            <div class="tg-row"><span class="tg-k">Engineers</span><span class="dots-old"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></div>
            <div class="tg-row"><span class="tg-k">QA</span><span class="dots-old"><span></span><span></span></span></div>
            <div class="tg-row"><span class="tg-k">DevOps</span><span class="dots-old"><span></span><span></span></span></div>
            <div class="tg-row"><span class="tg-k">Security</span><span class="dots-old"><span></span></span></div>
            <div class="tg-row"><span class="tg-k">Compliance</span><span class="dots-old"><span></span></span></div>
          </div>
          <footer>
            <div class="t-stat">
              <span class="ts-v">~70%</span>
              <span class="ts-k">of effort rebuilding plumbing per engagement</span>
            </div>
          </footer>
        </article>

        <article class="team team-new">
          <header>
            <span class="team-tag on">AI-native (Assembly)</span>
            <span class="team-count on">3 people</span>
          </header>
          <div class="team-grid">
            <div class="tg-row on">
              <span class="tg-k on">FDE</span>
              <span class="dots-new"><span class="fde">1</span></span>
              <span class="tg-meta">scopes · composes · ships</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tg-row on">
              <span class="tg-k on">QA</span>
              <span class="dots-new"><span class="qa">1</span></span>
              <span class="tg-meta">framework conformance · audits</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tg-row on">
              <span class="tg-k on">TPM</span>
              <span class="dots-new"><span class="tpm">1</span></span>
              <span class="tg-meta">customer surface · change requests</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="platform-bar">
            <div class="pb-label">
              <span class="pb-tag">Platform substrate</span>
              <span>handles the other 70% of effort, every time</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-list">
              <span>identity</span><span>audit</span><span>HITL</span><span>hosting</span><span>obs.</span><span>connectors</span><span>docgen</span><span>comms</span><span>search</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <footer>
            <div class="t-stat on">
              <span class="ts-v on">~5×</span>
              <span class="ts-k on">throughput per engineer vs body-shop baseline</span>
            </div>
          </footer>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- B. The 90/10 split -->
    <div class="moment">
      <div class="m-head">
        <span class="m-tag">B</span>
        <h3>The 90/10 split &mdash; AI vs expert human</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="split-card">
        <div class="split-bar">
          <div class="sb-ai">
            <span class="sb-pct">90%</span>
            <span class="sb-lbl">AI-generated against framework</span>
          </div>
          <div class="sb-hu">
            <span class="sb-pct">10%</span>
            <span class="sb-lbl">Expert human · the edges</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="split-where">
          <li><span class="sw-k">AI handles</span><span class="sw-v">workflow scaffolding · connector wiring · UI components · documentation · daily status · ticket grooming · routine PRs</span></li>
          <li><span class="sw-k">Humans handle</span><span class="sw-v">data migrations · gnarly integrations · compliance edge cases · architecture decisions · the call when the model is wrong</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="split-note">
          The split is the moat. AI generates against a <b>constrained framework</b> Assembly built over two years before shipping to a customer &mdash; not free-text codegen. The 10% is what makes the 90% trustworthy.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- C. Compounding curve -->
    <div class="moment">
      <div class="m-head">
        <span class="m-tag">C</span>
        <h3>Cost per engagement &mdash; over time</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="curve-card">
        <div class="curve-chart">
          <!-- Axis -->
          <div class="axis-y">
            <span>Cost / engagement</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Body-shop line: flat, high -->
          <div class="line line-old">
            <span class="dot-old" style="left: 0%"></span>
            <span class="dot-old" style="left: 16%"></span>
            <span class="dot-old" style="left: 32%"></span>
            <span class="dot-old" style="left: 48%"></span>
            <span class="dot-old" style="left: 64%"></span>
            <span class="dot-old" style="left: 80%"></span>
            <span class="dot-old" style="left: 96%"></span>
            <span class="line-label old">Body-shop SI &mdash; cost is flat (every engagement starts at zero)</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Platform-leverage line: descending -->
          <svg class="curve-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 60" preserveAspectRatio="none">
            <path d="M 0 10 Q 25 30, 50 40 T 100 52" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-indigo-600)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="line-label new">Platform leverage &mdash; cost drops as the substrate amortizes</div>

          <div class="axis-x">
            <span>P1</span><span>P2</span><span>P3</span><span>P4</span><span>P5</span><span>P6</span><span>P7</span>
            <span class="axis-x-label">→ engagements over time</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="curve-takeaways">
          <div class="ct">
            <span class="ct-v">P1</span>
            <span class="ct-k">First engagement: parity with body-shop cost</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ct">
            <span class="ct-v">P3</span>
            <span class="ct-k">Platform already replays sources, agents, connectors</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ct">
            <span class="ct-v">P7+</span>
            <span class="ct-k"><b>Marginal cost per engagement approaches zero</b></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .df {
    padding: 120px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
    background: #fff;
  }
  .s-head { max-width: 880px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
  .s-head .eyebrow { display: block; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .s-head h2 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 40px);
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
  }
  .s-head h2 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--color-indigo-600);
  }
  .s-head .lede {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .moment {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .moment:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .m-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .m-tag {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-ink-950);
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .m-head h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
  }

  /* ── A · Team composition ──────────────────────────────── */
  .teams {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 980px) { .teams { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .team {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .team-new {
    border-color: var(--color-indigo-600);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(15,17,42,.04), 0 16px 40px -24px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.32);
  }
  .team header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 20px;
    background: var(--color-ink-50);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
  }
  .team-new header {
    background: var(--color-indigo-50);
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-indigo-100);
  }
  .team-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-ink-950);
  }
  .team-tag.on { color: var(--color-indigo-700); }
  .team-count {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
    background: var(--color-ink-100);
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .team-count.on {
    background: var(--color-indigo-100);
    color: var(--color-indigo-700);
  }

  .team-grid {
    padding: 16px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .tg-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--color-ink-100);
  }
  .tg-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .tg-row.on { grid-template-columns: 60px auto 1fr; }
  .tg-k {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
  }
  .tg-k.on { color: var(--color-indigo-700); }
  .tg-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
  }

  .dots-old {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .dots-old span {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-ink-300);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-400);
  }
  .dots-new {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .dots-new span {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-indigo-600);
    color: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .platform-bar {
    margin: 4px 20px 12px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: var(--color-ink-950);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
  }
  .pb-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .pb-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-lavender-300);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    padding: 3px 7px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .pb-list {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .pb-list span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .team footer {
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
    background: var(--color-ink-50);
  }
  .team-new footer { background: #fff; }
  .t-stat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .ts-v {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
  }
  .ts-v.on { color: var(--color-indigo-700); }
  .ts-k {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .ts-k.on { color: var(--color-ink-700); }

  /* ── B · 90/10 split ───────────────────────────────────── */
  .split-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 28px;
  }
  .split-bar {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 9fr 1fr;
    gap: 4px;
    height: 60px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .sb-ai,
  .sb-hu {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    padding: 0 12px;
  }
  .sb-ai {
    background: var(--color-indigo-600);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .sb-hu {
    background: var(--color-ink-950);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .sb-pct {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .sb-lbl {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .split-where {
    margin-top: 20px;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .split-where { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .split-where li {
    background: var(--color-ink-50);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-100);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .sw-k {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-indigo-700);
  }
  .sw-v {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-ink-700);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .split-note {
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-ink-200);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-ink-500);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .split-note b { color: var(--color-ink-950); font-weight: 600; }

  /* ── C · Compounding curve ─────────────────────────────── */
  .curve-card {
    background: var(--color-ink-950);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 32px 32px 24px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .curve-chart {
    position: relative;
    height: 220px;
    padding: 14px 0 28px 60px;
  }
  .axis-y {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 28px;
    width: 50px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding-right: 10px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }
  .line {
    position: absolute;
    left: 60px;
    right: 0;
    height: 2px;
  }
  .line-old {
    top: 30px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }
  .dot-old {
    position: absolute;
    top: -3px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #fff;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }
  .line-label {
    position: absolute;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .line-label.old {
    top: -22px;
    left: 0;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }
  .line-label.new {
    bottom: 8px;
    right: 0;
    color: var(--color-indigo-500);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .curve-svg {
    position: absolute;
    left: 60px;
    right: 0;
    top: 18px;
    height: 160px;
    width: calc(100% - 60px);
  }
  .axis-x {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 60px;
    right: 0;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    padding-top: 8px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }
  .axis-x-label {
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    bottom: -18px;
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .curve-takeaways {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .curve-takeaways { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .ct {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .ct-v {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 24px;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .ct-k {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .ct-k b { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
